    {
      "id": "82581ecc7c6d4254",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 536.25,
      "height": 162.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2090102252,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 252940805,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781765628493,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design notes (vs. original Fig. 4.21):\n- File and AESKey are not separate collections; Firestore embeds\n  fileName/fileSize/encryptedAESKey/iv directly on TransferSession\n  (denormalized doc model, not 3NF normalization).\n- RSAKeys is replaced by RoleHandshake (role_handshake collection) -\n  per-session RSA exchange, not a standalone key store.\n- NeutralHandshake is new: the friend/connection layer (neutral_handshakes)\n  is independent of session-layer RoleHandshake, matching firestore.rules.\n- AuditLog (users/{uid}/audit_logs) is an immutable, append-only\n  sub-collection: update is always denied in firestore.rules.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 130.0,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design notes (vs. original Fig. 4.21):\n- File and AESKey are not separate collections; Firestore embeds\n  fileName/fileSize/encryptedAESKey/iv directly on TransferSession\n  (denormalized doc model, not 3NF normalization).\n- RSAKeys is replaced by RoleHandshake (role_handshake collection) -\n  per-session RSA exchange, not a standalone key store.\n- NeutralHandshake is new: the friend/connection layer (neutral_handshakes)\n  is independent of session-layer RoleHandshake, matching firestore.rules.\n- AuditLog (users/{uid}/audit_logs) is an immutable, append-only\n  sub-collection: update is always denied in firestore.rules.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
